# standalone
# The options menu (docs/ios-port/SETTINGS.md): Settings from the main menu, the Visual / Basic page, then Modded Exes.
# The menu cursor follows motion deltas and starts in the middle of the screen when a dialog opens, so a `move` after the first click is
# relative to where the script's own pointer was left (764 662): this is for a 3024x1964 window.
